  "title": "Dutch Boterkoek",
  "description": "This is a Dutch buttery bar cookie, baked in a round tin, and cut into wedges after baking. Instead of vanilla or lemon zest, you can flavor these with 4 ounces of ground almonds.",
  "authors": [
    "hanneke hartkoorn"
  ],
